1
00:00:00,719 --> 00:00:02,879
Hi, in this quick tutorial, I'm going to

2
00:00:02,879 --> 00:00:04,880
show you how to use the subtasks feature

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,960
in Blitzet. This feature is great when

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,320
you need to split tasks into smaller

5
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,719
steps. First, let's add a subtask. To do

6
00:00:12,719 --> 00:00:14,880
this, simply hover over any task in your

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,279
list. You'll see a little subtasks icon

8
00:00:17,279 --> 00:00:20,119
appear, click it, and a drop-down will

9
00:00:20,119 --> 00:00:23,480
expand. Now, type the title of your new

10
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,880
subtask and hit

11
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,640
enter. And there you go. Subtask is

12
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,599
added. You can add more in the same way.

13
00:00:31,599 --> 00:00:34,239
Managing your subtasks is easy, too. If

14
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:36,320
you want to reorder them, just hover

15
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,320
over a subtask and use the up or down

16
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:40,800
arrows to move it within the list. And

17
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,480
if you want to delete a subtask, just

18
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:45,040
click the trash icon. The subtasks

19
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,640
feature helps you visually track your

20
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,200
progress step by step. When you finish a

21
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,600
subtask, click the check box next to it

22
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,239
to mark it as done. You can see how the

23
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:56,640
progress dial updates instantly. It

24
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,399
shows how many subtasks you've completed

25
00:00:58,399 --> 00:00:59,480
so

26
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,760
far. Now, what about when you're in

27
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:05,040
blitzet mode? It works the similar way.

28
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:07,439
You can see the list of subtasks by

29
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:09,520
pressing the arrow button, and you can

30
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,280
add the new ones by pressing the plus

31
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,840
button, even while you are in focus

32
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:16,159
mode. Currently, you need to have at

33
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:18,320
least one subtask added to a task in

34
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:20,240
order to view and update subtasks in

35
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:23,360
focus mode. Oh, and one more cool thing.

36
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:25,119
If you use notion and integrate it with

37
00:01:25,119 --> 00:01:27,439
Blitzet, any checkbox properties in your

38
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:29,600
notion databases can be synced directly

39
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:32,720
as subtasks in Blitzet. Let's go back to

40
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,280
list view so I can show you an example.

41
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,560
Here you can see I have a task

42
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,240
integrated from notion together with

43
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:41,520
subtasks synced. Please note that synced

44
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,920
subtasks cannot be deleted from Blitzet

45
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,040
since they are linked to your notion

46
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,240
data. Let me show you this feature in

47
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,159
action within notion itself. You'll see

48
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,520
how your updates in Blitzet are

49
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:54,320
replicated here. Currently, notion is

50
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:56,320
available as an integration and very

51
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,920
soon we excited to roll out new

52
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,079
integrations that will include ClickUp,

53
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,799
Trello and other

54
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:05,119
platforms. So that's it. I hope that was

55
00:02:05,119 --> 00:02:07,439
helpful and clear for you. And if you

56
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:10,560
have any questions, proposals, ideas, or

57
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,680
would like to share your own

58
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,760
productivity tips, feel free to join our

59
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,959
Discord community. And stay tuned. A lot

60
00:02:16,959 --> 00:02:20,760
of new features are coming.